<title>USA: American Banknote buys security print unit.</title>
<headline>American Banknote buys security print unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Banknote Corp said on Monday its Brazilian subsidiary acquired the security print division of Companhia Melhoramentos de Sao Paulo, one of Brazil's four largest check printers, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>The company said it expected the acquisition to increase sales by about $6 million a year, and to strengthen its position as a provider to Brazil's financial community.</p>
<p>Melhoramentos's printing operation would be moved to American Banknote's new Sao Paulo facility in the next few months, the company said.</p>
</text>
